		DAILY_Lucid_Stats:9 = LucidDreamLoser()
		CALL LucidDreamTimeUp()
	ELSE
	PRINTFORMDW In the end, though, you manage to free yourself, but there is no toilet to be found...

	PRINTFORMDW You decide that the ocean would have to do. After all, everybody \@DAILY_Lucid_Stats:1?pees#\@\@DAILY_Lucid_Stats:1 && DAILY_Lucid_Stats:2?%" "%and%" "%#\@\@DAILY_Lucid_Stats:2?poops#\@ in the ocean, right?
