	PRINTFORMDW You don't want to bother them, or shout your predicament across the entire beach.
	PRINTFORMDW Instead, you decide to take it slowly and start digging, even as every motion puts pressure on your \@ DAILY_Lucid_Stats:1 ?bladder#\@\@ DAILY_Lucid_Stats:1 && DAILY_Lucid_Stats:2 ?%" and "%#\@\@ DAILY_Lucid_Stats:2 ? bowels#\@, not at all sure that you're going to make it.
